/*
 * A random NPC fisher sets up on the pier. They get drunk over time and can be driven off by Whitney. If tentacles drag you off the pier and the fisher is
 *  present, they may save you, after which they either demand sexual repayment (leading to a nonconsentual encounter combat if you refuse), or you can thank them 
 *  with a kiss. If you pull away after you do so, that also might lead to a nonconsentual encounter. If a fisher is present when you catch a fish, they may  
 *  drunkenly claim it and attack if you refuse. They can give you tips as well. They can also save you from getting blown off the pier, with similar outcomes
 *  as them saving you from the tentacles.
 */
:: Fishing Pier Fisher Arrive
<<effects>>
<<generate1>><<saveNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase to "fishing">>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.age to 0>>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.drunk to 0>>

A <<person>> walks onto the pier with a fishing rod, setting up a short distance away from you.
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	<<He>> glances at your <<lewdness>> as <<he>> sets up. "Looks like I picked the right spot today," <<he>> says with a quiet chuckle.
	<<fameexhibitionism 2>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Tips Offer
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.tipGiven to true>>

<<switch random(1, 3)>>
	<<case 1>>
		The <<person>> watches you for a moment, then takes a few steps toward you. "Hey, do you want some help? You look like you're fighting the fish more than you need to."
	<<case 2>>
		The <<person>> reels in, pauses, then adjusts something on <<his>> setup before casting again. After a moment <<he>> glances over. "I know this spot fairly well. Happy to share what I know, if you want."
	<<case 3>>
		The <<person>> reels in and checks <<his>> bait carefully, then glances over towards you. "How are you getting on?" <<He>> asks. "I know a couple of tricks for this spot, if you want to hear them."
<</switch>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Sure|Fishing Pier Fisher Tips]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[No thanks|Fishing Pier Fisher Tips Decline]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Tips
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<switch random(1, 3)>>
	<<case 1>>
		The <<person>> demonstrates a few casts, pointing out where <<he>> aims and how <<he>> adjusts the tension as the line settles.
	<<case 2>>
		The <<person>> shows you how <<he>> positions <<his>> hands on the rod before casting, watching where the line lands and adjusting.
	<<case 3>>
		The <<person>> crouches by the railing and points to where the current cuts around the edge of the pier, explaining where the fish tend to sit.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

After a while <<he>> turns back to <<his>> own rod, apparently satisfied.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Tips Decline
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>

<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I'm alright, thanks," you say quietly.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I'm fine," you say, not looking up from your line.
<<else>>
	"Thanks, but I'm good," you say.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"Suit yourself," <<he>> says, and turns back to <<his>> rod.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Cliff Tip Offer
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>

The <<person>> reels in slowly, glancing over. "You've been at it a while now. Since you seem to know what you're doing, there's a spot I haven't told many people about."
<br><br>

<<link [[Sure|Fishing Pier Fisher Cliff Tip]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[No thanks|Fishing Pier Fisher Tips Decline]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Cliff Tip
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<run $fishing.locationsFound.pushUnique("fishingCoastPath")>>

"East of town, along the coastal path," <<he>> says. "There's a side path cuts down to the water. There's a dock at the bottom, old, but the spot itself is nice. Good fishing. Not many people bother making the trip, so the water's cleaner out there, less trash floating around."
<br><br>

<<He>> turns back to <<his>> rod.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Leave Night
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase to "finished">>

The <<person>> glances up at the darkening sky and starts to pack up <<his>> fishing gear. "I'm not a fan of night fishing around these parts. You should head home too."
<br><br>

<<clearNPC "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Leave Weather
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase to "finished">>

The <<person>> looks up as the weather begins to turn rough, then begins to pack up <<his>> fishing gear. "The weather is turning, I'm going to head home before it gets any worse. You should head out too."
<br><br>

<<clearNPC "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Whitney Bully Fisher
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
Whitney and a couple of <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends stroll onto the pier, laughing about something. "Hey, you, the <<person>>" Whitney calls while walking up to you. "You're in our spot."
<br><br>

The <<person>> glances over, caught off guard. <<He>> looks between Whitney and <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends, then at <<his>> rod. After a moment <<he>> starts packing up without a word, shaking <<his>> head as <<he>> leaves the pier. 
<br><br>

Whitney watches <<him>> go with a satisfied smirk, then turns to <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends. "Come on. Let's set up here."
<br><br>

<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase to "finished">>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.whitney.phase to "idle">>
<<clearNPC "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Whitney Bully Fisher Greet Player]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Fishing Pier Whitney Bully Fisher Player Leave]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Events [widget]
<<widget "fishingPierFisherAmbient">>
	<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.age += 1>>
	<<cleareventpool>>

	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> reels in, checks the empty hook, and lets out a quiet sigh before casting back out.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 5>>
		The <<personsimple>> reels in, re-baits the hook, and casts back out.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> reels in, takes a small fish off the hook and tosses it back before casting back out.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> reels in, takes a small fish off the hook and stores it in <<his>> cooler before casting back out.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> picks a clump of seaweed off <<his>> line and casts back out.
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> works <<his>> line free from a snag near the pier posts.
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<if $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.drunk gte 3>>
		<<addinlineevent 15>>
			The <<personsimple>> sways slightly on <<his>> feet, rod dipping toward the water.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 1>>
			The <<personsimple>> reels in, squints at the hook, and mutters something under <<his>> breath before casting sloppily back out.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 1>>
			The <<personsimple>> tugs <<his>> line free from a snag with more force than necessary, nearly losing <<his>> footing.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 1>>
			The <<personsimple>> fumbles with the bait for a moment before managing to hook it, then casts back out with a grunt.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 1>>
			The <<personsimple>> glances over at you, eyes a little unfocused. <<He>> gives you a slow, lopsided smile before turning back to <<his>> rod.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 2>>
			The <<personsimple>> loses <<his>> balance for a moment, grabbing the railing to steady <<himself>>. <<He>> laughs softly to <<himself>>.
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<<else>>
		<<addinlineevent 15>>
			The <<personsimple>> stands a few paces away, quiet and focused on <<his>> line.
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> reaches for <<his>> bottle on the railing and takes a drink.
		<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.drunk += 1>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
	<<addinlineevent 1>>
		The <<personsimple>> picks up the bottle and drinks from it, then goes back to <<his>> rod.
		<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.drunk += 1>>
	<</addinlineevent>>

	<<if $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.age gte 4>>
		<<addinlineevent 7>>
		<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.age to 0>>
			The <<personsimple>> suddenly braces, struggling with the line as <<his>> rod bends around. After a tense moment, <<he>> reels in and pulls out a fish with a satisfied grunt. <<He>> holds it up briefly before unhooking it and dropping it in <<his>> cooler.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent 12>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.age to 0>>
			The <<personsimple>> suddenly braces, fighting with the line as it pulls <<his>> rod around. Then <<he>> jolts back as whatever was on the line escapes.
			<<if $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.drunk gte 3>>
				<<He>> swears loudly, fumbling with <<his>> line before eventually getting it hooked and cast back out.
			<<else>>
				With a sigh, <<he>> re-hooks <<his>> line and casts back out.
			<</if>>
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<if $exposed gte 1>>
		<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisherOgle ??= 1>>
		<<addinlineevent $daily.fishing.pier.fisherOgle>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisherOgle += 1>>
			The <<personsimple>>'s gaze drifts towards your <<lewdness>> before <<he>> turns back to <<his>> line.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent $daily.fishing.pier.fisherOgle>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisherOgle += 1>>
			The <<personsimple>> glances over your <<lewdness>> with a long, slow look before turning back to <<his>> rod.
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $exposed gte 2>>
		<<addinlineevent $daily.fishing.pier.fisherOgle>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisherOgle += 2>>
			The <<personsimple>> stares openly at your <<lewdness>>, not bothering to look away when you catch <<him>> looking.
		<</addinlineevent>>
		<<addinlineevent $daily.fishing.pier.fisherOgle>>
			<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisherOgle += 2>>
			The <<personsimple>> looks over your <<lewdness>> with a slow, deliberate stare, not paying any attention to <<his>> rod.
		<</addinlineevent>>
	<</if>>

	<<runeventpool>>
<</widget>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Accept
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
The <<person>> snatches it from your hands and staggers off the pier, muttering about "respekt" and "my spot."
<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
<br><br>

<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase to "finished">>
<<clearNPC "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Refuse
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"But I caught it... it's mine."
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Not a chance. Get your own."
<<else>>
	"No. I caught it."
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<He>> narrows <<his>> eyes. "I tend to take what I want," <<he>> says as <<he>> strides towards you.<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Fight|Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Molestation]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Molestation
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<set $enemyno to 1>>
	<<maninit>>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>
<<alarmstate>>
<<man>>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>

<<actionsman>>

<<if _combatend>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Molestation]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Molestation Finish
<<effects>>
<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase to "finished">>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<ejaculation>>
	<<He>> shudders and pulls away, breathing hard. After a moment, <<he>> staggers upright and walks off down the pier without a word.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you get to your feet.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<<clearNPC "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<<He>> stumbles back, gasping. <<He>> looks at you for a moment, then turns and walks off down the pier.
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you gather yourself.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<tending_give $fishingHookedFish.type 1>>
	<<unset $fishingHookedFish>>
	<<clearNPC "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">>

	<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Leave|Dock Pier]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


