:: Fishing Pier Fisher Saved On Pier
<<effects>>
<<if dangerEvent(1, 9900 - $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.drunk * 600, V.allure, true)>>
	The fisher steps closer, <<his>> eyes darkening. "That's it? Not even a thanks?" <<He>> looks around, then leans even closer to you. You can feel <<his>> breath<<if $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.drunk gte 1>>, sour with alcohol<</if>>.
	<br><br>

	<<if $phase is 0>>"I nearly went over that railing with you,"<<else>>"I risked getting pulled in for you,"<</if>> <<he>> says, voice low. "You could show me a little more appreciation." <<He>> reaches down and adjusts <<his>> crotch. "Get on your knees. You should know what I want."<<stress 4>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>

	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 3)>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Pier Fisher Coerced Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Comply reluctantly|Fishing Pier Fisher Coerced Sex]]>><<set $molestationstart to 1>><<set $phase to 2>><<stress 6>><<trauma 6>><</link>><<gstress>><<gtrauma>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if hasSexStat("promiscuity", 4)>>
		<<link [[Comply eagerly|Fishing Pier Fisher Coerced Sex]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>><<promiscuous4>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<link [[Refuse|Fishing Pier Fisher Want Sex Refuse]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	The <<person>> gives you a friendly pat on the shoulder before giving a worried glance towards the water. <<He>> then turns and starts packing up <<his>> gear.
	<br><br>

	"I'm heading in, stay safe. You're worth more than your equipment" <<he>> says as <<he>> walks away down the pier.
	<br><br>

	<<set $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase to "finished">>
	<<clearNPC "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<</if>>



