:: Widgets Fishing Pier Fisher Catch [widget]

<<widget "fishingPierCaughtFisherDrunk">>
	<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
	<<run updateFishRecord($fishingHookedFish.type, $fishingHookedFish.size, $bus)>>
	<<run stopFishingProp()>>
	<<set _fishPropName to "caught-" + $fishingHookedFish.type>>
	<<wearProp _fishPropName>>

	<<fishingCatchFishText $fishingHookedFish>>
	<br><br>

	The <<person>> stares at your catch for a moment, eyes narrowing. <<He>> straightens up unsteadily and takes a step toward you. "That one's mine, I had a line right there. Hand it over."
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Give <<him>> the fish|Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Accept]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Refuse|Fishing Pier Fisher Take Fish Refuse]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>
